OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry and fine this evening with plenty
OL,7,Fof evening sunshine. Skies will turn
OL,8,Fcloudy overnight with the odd spot of
OL,9,Frain in the west through the early
OL,10,Fhours. Another rather mild night ahead
OL,11,Fwith light winds throughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA rather cloudy start but some
OL,14,Fbreaks will develop allowing some
OL,15,Fsunshine. Feeling warm and humid with
OL,16,Fa few spots of rain possible, which
OL,17,Fmay turn heavier later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
