OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fis likely to move across the region on
OL,7,Fat first on Tuesday, perhaps with some
OL,8,Fheavier bursts. This clears to
OL,9,Fsunshine and showers, continuing
OL,10,Fthrough Wednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
